---
// Opts a page into Astro's ClientRouter navigation: the router reads these
// on the current page and on each fetched one (a page without them loads
// whole). Astro's <ClientRouter /> renders the same tags, but its script
// and style can't build in an .astro outside an app's root, which the kit
// always is; page-router.ts (app-nav.ts) is its client half instead.
---
<meta name="astro-view-transitions-enabled" content="true" />
<meta name="astro-view-transitions-fallback" content="animate" />
